ance Comes From", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-2", "num": "22.2", "title": "Why Accuracy Lies", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-3", "num": "22.3", "title": "Resampling", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-4", "num": "22.4", "title": "Class Weights and Cost-Sensitive Learning", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-5", "num": "22.5", "title": "Threshold Tuning under Imbalance", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-6", "num": "22.6", "title": "Resampling Inside the Fold", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-7", "num": "22.7", "title": "The Leakage Taxonomy", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-7-1", "num": "22.7.1", "title": "Target leakage", "lvl": 4}, {"id": "s22-7-2", "num": "22.7.2", "title": "Train/test contamination", "lvl": 4}, {"id": "s22-7-3", "num": "22.7.3", "title": "Temporal leakage", "lvl": 4}, {"id": "s22-7-4", "num": "22.7.4", "title": "Group leakage", "lvl": 4}, {"id": "s22-7-5", "num": "22.7.5", "title": "Duplicate rows", "lvl": 4}, {"id": "s22-8", "num": "22.8", "title": "Auditing a Suspiciously Good Score", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-9", "num": "22.9", "title": "In Practice", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s22-9-1", "num": "22.9.1", "title": "A worked case: a churn model that has to survive review", "lvl": 4}, {"id": "s22-9-2", "num": "22.9.2", "title": "When to reach for what", "lvl": 4}, {"id": "s22-9-3", "num": "22.9.3", "title": "What goes wrong in production", "lvl": 4}], "code": 43, "figs": 2, "words": 3418, "minutes": 46}, {"n": 23, "title": "Pipelines and Hyperparameter Tuning", "scope": "Wiring every preprocessing step and the estimator into one object - then searching over the whole thing at once.", "covers": "Pipeline/ColumnTransformer, custom transformers, grid/random/halving/Optuna search, nested CV", "part": "VI", "sections": [{"id": "s23-1", "num": "23.1", "title": "Why Pipelines Exist", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s23-2", "num": "23.2", "title": "Pipeline and ColumnTransformer", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s23-3", "num": "23.3", "title": "Custom Transformers", "lvl": 3}, {"id": "s23-4", "num": "23.4", "title": "Parameters versus Hyperparameters, 